sequenceDiagram
  participant TideGrid
  participant Twilio
  participant Recipient
  participant Inbox as Webhook inbox

  TideGrid->>Twilio: Send with message idempotency metadata
  Twilio->>Recipient: SMS
  Twilio->>TideGrid: Delivery status callback
  TideGrid->>Inbox: Verify and store callback
  Recipient->>Twilio: Reply or STOP
  Twilio->>TideGrid: Incoming webhook with OptOutType
  TideGrid->>Inbox: Store inbound event
  TideGrid->>TideGrid: Update delivery, conversation, and consent
  alt Opted out
    TideGrid->>TideGrid: Block later prohibited messages
  end
